{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003600/extras/174c487e78c48ff20a8d2666c42d630a.avif?t=1738086628\" width=429 height=272 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-ENTER INTO NASHBORED-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what lies in your mind. The complexities of life become laid bare as information and memories, lost in the slurry of day soup that surrounds your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In that chaos, many things can hide and take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in a spiral and displayed on a sadistic gameshow for higher beings,<br>Nash will be thrust into the depths of her own mind.<br>Help her to navigate the strange pathways, and try to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-The Upper Dreamscape is a dangerous place-</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore through strange memories, meet weird entities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight psycho enemies who want you dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange prerendered realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle to survive!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"44e538858a7a9627c17d217e6a86f59a4e8bc231.jpg","localized_name":"Dream Complete","name":"Dream Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1003600/44e538858a7a9627c17d217e6a86f59a4e8bc231.jpg"},{"icon":"0d48cce196343b451a63ad194e54d744d6cc07b4.jpg","localized_name":"The thing on the floor...","name":"The thing on the floor...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1003600/0d48cce196343b451a63ad194e54d744d6cc07b4.jpg"},{"icon":"dc15b0d36119e38bf4ac866c4afbecf8ef5fe719.jpg","localized_name":"Elsewhere...","name":"Elsewhere..